<main><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="crumbs">CRANIO / TwinMind</div><h1>TwinMind</h1><p class="lead">TwinMind is designed to connect experience, context, state, observations and history. Its personal account and persistent history are not connected yet. The website currently explains the model and lets you explore the observation framework.</p><section class="section"><h2>Continue exploring</h2><div class="grid"><a class="card" href="../experience/"><h3>For You</h3><p>Your experience</p></a><a class="card" href="../cases/"><h3>Cases</h3><p>What a useful record contains</p></a><a class="card" href="../method/"><h3>Method</h3><p>Observe → Calibrate → Identify → Optimize → Verify</p></a></div></section><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../start/">Start</a></div></article></div></main>